  "briefing": "Tidewater Consortium holds Northern Ireland through its harbour yard. Reconnect 3 relays, take down the site warden, hold the uplink while it broadcasts, unlock the service gate, then leave by the exit. Expect 5 enemy agents and 2 guards on the streets.",
